    <h1 class="as-title">论冬天去一趟大西北是什么体验！<span class="as-rating" style="--rating: 2.7;" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"></span></h1>
  </header>

  <h1>这次在西宁市呆了两天，体验到了当地不一样的风土人情以及当地神圣的氛围。</h1>
    <h2>Day 1</h2>
    <h3>我们第一天的行程选择了西宁市-->橡皮山-->茶卡盐湖-->青海湖-->西宁市这条路线</h3>
    <figure >
      <img alt="西宁、橡皮山、茶卡盐湖和青海湖第一天的行程图" width="590px" height="444px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20230207/qinghaitravel1/day1.png">
    </figure>
    <h4>由于路途很长，所以早上5点多钟就起床了，这种一日游的旅行建议报一个当地的旅行团（5-6人的那种）。因为司机师傅可以带着你随便逛，到处都可以拍照。</h4>
    <b>凌晨的路</b>
    <figure >
      <img alt="清晨出发时的道路" width="624px" height="416px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20230207/qinghaitravel1/lu.jpg">
    </figure>
    <h4>第一站地是橡皮山，海拔3817米，当时风特别大，一下车整个人都好像被风吹起来似的，加上高海拔的原因，难以呼吸。</h4>
    <figure >
      <img alt="冬季的橡皮山" width="624px" height="416px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20230207/qinghaitravel1/xiangpishan.jpg">
    </figure>
    <h4>而茶卡盐湖和青海湖这两个地方冬天确实不要来，太冷太冷了，把手伸出来一会就没了感觉。站在湖边远远的望去，一马平川，全是冰。</h4>
    <figure >
      <img alt="冬季的茶卡盐湖" width="624px" height="416px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20230207/qinghaitravel1/chaka.jpg">
    </figure>
    <figure >
      <img alt="冬季的青海湖" width="624px" height="416px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20230207/qinghaitravel1/yanhu.jpg">
    </figure>

    <h2>Day 2</h2>
    <h3>我们第二天的行程选择了西宁市-->拉脊山-->塔尔寺-->西宁市这条路线</h3>
    <figure >
      <img alt="西宁、拉脊山和塔尔寺第二天的行程图" width=width="590px" height="444px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20230207/qinghaitravel1/day2.png">
    </figure>
    <h4>这条线我们是包了一辆车和一个司机，一天300快。因为这条线也是人烟稀少，几乎打不到车。</h4>
    <h4>拉脊山比昨天的橡皮山就更高了，4188米。司机师傅说一般驾车去拉萨都要走这条路，如果这条路没发生高反那就没问题。</h4>
    <figure >
      <img alt="拉脊山沿途景色" width="624px" height="416px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20230207/qinghaitravel1/jishan.jpg">
    </figure>
    <figure >
      <img alt="拉脊山上的旅行照片" width="624px" height="416px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20230207/qinghaitravel1/la.jpg">
    </figure>
    <h4>塔尔寺内不让拍照，所以只能在寺外照了一张。</h4>
    <figure >
      <img alt="塔尔寺外景" width="624px" height="416px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20230207/qinghaitravel1/taersi.jpg">
    </figure>


